Bun 1.0.7 advances its filesystem cache generation after draining the build
queue, so a subsequent build can miss an entry point created in between.
Prepare all entry points before starting the bundler.  A sleep does not
synchronize the two threads.

Related report: oven-sh/bun#7373 describes Bun.build failing to resolve a
file immediately after Bun.write, even though the file can be read back:
https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues/7373

Seed cache generation:
https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/bun-v1.0.7/src/bundler/bundle_v2.zig

